[ti:Hemant Jogi aakhda sun shaheed shera]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Folk & Regional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:15.83]Hemant Jogi aakhda, sun shaheed shera
[00:23.66]Main tap kita janglan vich, main jaap kita gufavan vich
[00:31.50]Par tere darshan hoe, taan samjhiya jog ki hai
[00:39.33]Tera naam hai mera mantra, teri shahadat hai mera jaap
[00:47.16]Main sannyasi si, sansaar ton bhajjia
[00:54.99]Par tu mainu sikhaya ki sachha sannyas ki hai
[01:02.83]Sachha sannyasi oh nahi jo jangal bhajje
[01:10.66]Sachha sannyasi oh hai jo shaheed di maa de dar te jhuke
[01:18.49]He shaheed shera, main tainu ki bhet karaan?
[01:26.32]Mere kol kuch nahi — na sona, na chandi, na maal
[01:34.15]Mere kol sirf ikk jogi di jholi hai
[01:41.99]Uh jholi main tere naam karda haan
[01:49.82]Hun ton main shaheedan da bhikhari haan
[02:05.48]Mardana bolia —
[02:13.32]Hemant Jogi da uffara sun liya main
[02:21.15]Hun ih rabab vi shaheedan di ho gayi
[02:28.98]Jihadi dhuni Nanak di seva vich vajji
[02:36.81]Hun uh dhuni shaheedan de naam te goonjegi
[02:52.48]Hemant Jogi da uffara swikaar hai
[03:08.14]Sach da faqir hun sach de shaheed da sevadaar hoyia
[03:23.81]Jogi di jholi hun shaheedan da khazaana hai
[03:39.47]Hemant Jogi, tu shaheedan da jogi hai
[03:55.13]He shaheed shera!
[04:02.97]Terri yaad hai mera tap
[04:10.80]Tera sach hai mera jog
[04:18.63]Terri maa hai meri devi
[04:26.46]Tera naam hai mera rabb
[04:34.30]Ih jholi main tere naam karda haan
[04:42.13]Hun ton main shaheedan da jogi haan
